    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Reviewed native action · rules reference</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>You hunker behind your shield, listening to the hard knocks against its face.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Reaction</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>None — no roll</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>Self, before a defense against an attack the DA judges blockable</dd></div><div><dt>Duration</dt><dd>Until the start of your next turn</dd></div><div><dt>Equipment / acquisition</dt><dd>None.</dd></div><div><dt>Limits</dt><dd>Repeatable; pay the action and any stated costs each use.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Universal</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Requires a held shield; grants none. Gain 1 Boon to eligible defense rolls while using it. Creatures use the same rule.</p></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/9bc9b4fe3256e68880b92c45facf0f25b98a1ea3/design/cards/shield-block.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/shield-block.md</a> at <code>9bc9b4fe3256e68880b92c45facf0f25b98a1ea3</code>.</p></section>",
